  "translation": "On the terrible surface of his forehead a fire blazes <i>dhagad dhagad</i>, and into it he offered the mighty <b>five-arrowed Kāma as an oblation</b>. He is the <b>one true artist</b> who paints decorative designs on the body of Parvati, daughter of the king of mountains. My love is for the <b>three-eyed one</b>.",
